Summer 2019 applications are closed as of May 17th 2019. Applications 
received by the May 17th deadline are under review and results will be 
announced by the end of this week.

Applications for Fall 2019 will be open on June 17th. If you are aiming 
for Fall 2019, you are welcome to continue your efforts to learn and get 
up to speed on the kernel development process.

If you have any questions, please feel free to reach out to me.

